WEBVTT

00:00.810 --> 00:05.000
Cake! Cake! Fluffy cake!

00:05.000 --> 00:09.670
Fluffy cake I wanna eat every day!

00:08.600 --> 00:10.610
You can't eat it every day, Shuri.

00:09.670 --> 00:13.820
Cake! Cake! Fluffy cake!

00:13.820 --> 00:17.890
Fluffy cake I wanna eat every day!

00:14.230 --> 00:17.880
But we'll be able to eat it 
whenever we want soon.

00:17.880 --> 00:22.070
We have to ask Ms. Morin if they'll be 
able to bake it for the store first.

00:20.030 --> 00:22.370
Cake! Cake!

00:22.370 --> 00:24.030
Yeah! Got it!

00:24.030 --> 00:29.670
Cake! Cake! Fluffy cake I wanna...

00:30.340 --> 00:35.110
Goodness, why didn't you tell us 
that you moved to Crimonia?!

00:35.110 --> 00:37.700
I sent your father a letter about it.

00:37.700 --> 00:40.520
You told Dad?! He didn't say anything!

00:40.520 --> 00:42.320
How strange...

00:42.810 --> 00:44.520
Maybe he forgot to mention it?

00:44.830 --> 00:47.660
You're terrible, Dad!

00:47.660 --> 00:51.600
I almost wandered aimlessly 
in the royal capital!

00:51.600 --> 00:52.990
Now, now.

00:53.360 --> 01:00.060
I would have never found you two if 
a girl dressed as a bear didn't tell me...

01:00.490 --> 01:01.740
Bear?

01:02.330 --> 01:05.400
Ms. Morin, Miss Karin, are you in?

01:05.400 --> 01:07.040
Th-The bear?!

01:11.340 --> 01:12.130
Who're you?

01:12.130 --> 01:14.860
We met in the royal capital! I'm Nerin!

02:49.290 --> 02:52.600
It seems like you helped Nerin out, Yuna.

02:52.600 --> 02:57.940
I heard she was a relative of yours. 
What a crazy happenstance.

02:57.940 --> 03:00.430
So, she's your niece.

03:00.430 --> 03:03.910
Thank you very much for all your help.

03:03.910 --> 03:06.900
I'll pay you back after I earn some money.

03:06.900 --> 03:08.850
Please wait a little longer.

03:08.850 --> 03:10.080
Earn money?

03:10.080 --> 03:13.920
I visited Auntie Morin to work in her shop.

03:13.920 --> 03:14.880
Huh?

03:14.880 --> 03:17.310
Is that okay, Auntie Morin?

03:19.160 --> 03:24.950
Well, I'd love to have you work here, 
but we'll have to ask Yuna.

03:24.950 --> 03:25.720
Huh?

03:25.720 --> 03:28.520
Miss Yuna is the owner of the shop here.

03:30.050 --> 03:32.310
Th-The owner?!

03:33.850 --> 03:35.560
So that's how it is.

03:35.560 --> 03:39.560
No wonder this shop has 
such a strong bear motif.

03:39.560 --> 03:42.200
Even the forks and cups have bears on them!

03:43.410 --> 03:46.250
The attention to the 
bear details is amazing...

03:46.250 --> 03:49.200
<i>It's not my personal taste, though.</i>

03:49.580 --> 03:53.010
Miss Yuna, will you allow me to work here?

03:53.350 --> 03:56.340
I want to study breadmaking!

03:56.800 --> 04:02.590
My husband told Nerin he'd 
teach her when she was little.

04:03.620 --> 04:06.550
I'd also like to ask you to hire her.

04:06.550 --> 04:08.100
Please!

04:09.150 --> 04:10.720
Yeah. Sure.

04:11.770 --> 04:15.200
Thank you very much! I will work hard!

04:16.830 --> 04:19.180
Sorry for everything, Yuna.

04:19.180 --> 04:21.030
By the way, what brings you here today?

04:21.430 --> 04:23.860
You all showed up on a day
the shop is closed.

04:23.860 --> 04:24.630
Oh!

04:24.630 --> 04:25.700
That's right.

04:25.700 --> 04:26.820
Cake!

04:26.820 --> 04:31.400
We wanted to discuss something 
with the two of you...

04:42.220 --> 04:45.070
Sis, it's so delicious every time we eat it!

04:45.070 --> 04:47.260
Shuri, you're going to drop your strawberry.

04:47.260 --> 04:51.470
What is this white stuff? 
It's so sweet and strange!

04:51.470 --> 04:53.230
It's whipped cream.

04:53.230 --> 04:56.400
Miss Yuna, you can even bake sweets...

04:56.400 --> 04:58.210
Just a bit.

04:58.210 --> 05:02.740
We were thinking of adding 
this shortcake to the menu.

05:02.740 --> 05:04.360
Don't you think it'll be popular?

05:04.700 --> 05:07.820
Hmm, that'll be a bit difficult...

05:08.180 --> 05:09.370
Huh?!

05:09.370 --> 05:12.540
We can't eat lots and lots 
of this fluffy cake?

05:12.540 --> 05:15.310
We don't have time to bake it.

05:15.310 --> 05:18.880
We already bake a substantial 
amount and variety of breads.

05:20.510 --> 05:22.840
That's the main problem, huh?

05:24.110 --> 05:27.760
Um, can just anyone make this cake?

05:27.760 --> 05:30.120
I think anyone could if they learned how.

05:30.120 --> 05:33.220
It's not a difficult recipe.

05:33.930 --> 05:37.190
Then allow me to make it!

05:37.190 --> 05:38.650
Huh?

05:38.650 --> 05:41.980
But you just said you were here 
to study breadmaking.

05:41.980 --> 05:42.730
Yes.

05:42.730 --> 05:47.130
But I'd like to bake this cake since
 they don't have enough time to do it.

05:47.130 --> 05:48.250
Are you sure?

05:48.250 --> 05:52.410
It'd be unfortunate if the shop 
didn't sell something this delicious.

05:52.410 --> 05:55.040
Please teach me how to make bread 
on the days the shop is closed.

06:04.070 --> 06:06.260
I won't let you sell 
anything that tastes bad.

06:06.800 --> 06:08.610
I'll practice hard!

06:08.970 --> 06:09.890
Got it.

06:09.890 --> 06:12.610
If you're that determined, 
I'll have you take on the job.

06:12.610 --> 06:14.040
Thank you very much!

06:14.040 --> 06:16.860
Okay, let me show you 
how to bake it right now.

06:16.860 --> 06:18.830
I wanna try, too!

06:18.830 --> 06:20.440
If we won't get in your way...

06:20.440 --> 06:22.510
Okay. Let's all make it together.

06:22.510 --> 06:23.240
Yeah!

06:23.240 --> 06:23.920
Yes!

06:23.920 --> 06:25.530
I can't wait!

06:25.900 --> 06:28.570
I'll work hard to make 
lots of delicious cakes!

06:30.550 --> 06:31.910
Hello!

06:32.280 --> 06:34.490
Miss Yuna?! Fina?!

06:34.490 --> 06:36.210
Hello, Lady Noa?!

06:36.210 --> 06:37.010
Fina!

06:37.010 --> 06:40.790
I read the letter! You visited 
the royal capital with Miss Yuna?!

06:40.790 --> 06:46.020
I also wanted to go with you 
if you planned to see Mother!

06:46.020 --> 06:48.970
Miss Yuna, you should have 
invited me to go with you!

06:48.970 --> 06:52.510
We just went to buy Fina's work tools.

06:52.510 --> 06:55.450
Meeting Ms. Ellalaura 
was just a coincidence.

06:55.450 --> 06:57.140
Is that so?

07:02.160 --> 07:03.030
Here you go.

07:06.860 --> 07:08.860
Please have some, too, Ms. Lala.

07:08.860 --> 07:09.700
But...

07:09.700 --> 07:15.250
We made a lot while we were practicing. 
I'd like to hear your opinion of it.

07:24.850 --> 07:27.170
This cake is quite delicious!

07:27.170 --> 07:28.680
Great.

07:29.240 --> 07:30.130
Is it too sweet?

07:32.000 --> 07:36.100
It's a little sweet, but that 
sweetness goes quite well with tea.

07:37.270 --> 07:43.120
This rich cream gives this dessert 
such a deep yet mellow flavor.

07:43.120 --> 07:45.270
Whoa, just the review 
you'd expect from a noble.

07:48.550 --> 07:52.040
I don't drink tea often, 
but it's very delicious.

07:52.490 --> 07:54.570
Should we sell some at the shop?

07:54.570 --> 07:58.000
Would you like Lala to teach you?

07:58.000 --> 08:01.680
It is quite difficult to brew delicious tea.

08:01.680 --> 08:04.790
Unfortunately, I can't abandon my duties...

08:04.790 --> 08:08.800
Let me ask Father. I'm sure he will allow it!

08:11.910 --> 08:14.470
I understand. As long as you would have me.

08:14.470 --> 08:17.430
I'll come to teach as well!

08:17.840 --> 08:20.390
Are you planning to disregard your studies?

08:20.390 --> 08:22.720
N-Not at all!

08:26.170 --> 08:28.550
No way! No way! No way! No way!
No way! No way! No way!

08:28.550 --> 08:29.640
There's no way!

08:29.640 --> 08:32.660
I can't go to the lord's mansion 
to learn about tea!

08:32.660 --> 08:35.900
It's not like the lord is 
going to teach you himself.

08:35.900 --> 08:38.770
That's not the problem here!

08:38.770 --> 08:43.210
A commoner like me shouldn't be 
visiting the lord's mansion...

08:43.860 --> 08:50.170
I guess I'll have to learn from Ms. Lala 
and teach you when I get back.

08:50.170 --> 08:52.950
Welp, let's work hard, Fina!

08:52.950 --> 08:55.180
Huh? M-Me?!

08:55.630 --> 08:59.390
First, I'll explain things while 
I brew the tea. Please watch carefully.

08:57.930 --> 09:02.850
<b>Bear, Studying Black Tea</b>

08:57.930 --> 09:02.850
<b>Bear, Studying Black Tea</b>

08:59.390 --> 09:01.950
After that, I'll have you two do the same.

09:01.950 --> 09:03.150
Please take care of us!

09:03.150 --> 09:04.550
Please take care of us...

09:11.260 --> 09:13.130
How does it taste?

09:13.560 --> 09:16.690
Hmm. It's a little bitter.

09:16.690 --> 09:19.370
I feel like mine tastes bland...

09:19.370 --> 09:21.410
Miss Yuna brewed the tea for too long.

09:21.410 --> 09:24.450
Miss Fina did not use enough tea leaves.

09:24.450 --> 09:28.920
It's just like you said. It's hard 
to get the hang of it right away.

09:29.280 --> 09:33.130
Once you remember, you will always 
be able to drink delicious tea.

09:33.450 --> 09:36.990
I used to keep notes when I first started.

09:36.990 --> 09:38.870
Let's keep practicing.

09:39.660 --> 09:41.050
I'll write notes, too!

09:41.050 --> 09:42.590
Until you get used to it,

09:42.590 --> 09:45.920
be extra careful about the brew 
time and the water temperature.

09:45.920 --> 09:48.640
Eventually, you'll get the feeling for it.

09:49.060 --> 09:50.960
Yes, Teacher Lala.

10:11.410 --> 10:12.880
How are things going?

10:12.880 --> 10:14.840
Father!

10:14.840 --> 10:18.050
I heard you were all brewing tea.

10:18.050 --> 10:19.680
Did you come to make fun of us?

10:19.990 --> 10:22.260
Our lord has a lot of free time.

10:22.620 --> 10:27.480
Yeah, I do. That's why I'm here 
for some of your tea.

10:27.480 --> 10:28.440
Ugh.

10:28.440 --> 10:29.610
Huh?!

11:08.710 --> 11:11.500
It passes, barely.

11:11.500 --> 11:14.610
I thought we did pretty well...

11:14.610 --> 11:18.040
It's impressive that 
Father gave his approval.

11:18.040 --> 11:20.580
Yes, I believe you passed as well.

11:20.580 --> 11:23.270
The two of you have improved a lot.

11:23.270 --> 11:26.500
Me, too! I will give you two passing grades!

11:27.720 --> 11:29.500
Thank you very much.

11:32.130 --> 11:34.080
This goes really well with tea.

11:34.080 --> 11:37.120
Come eat it at the shop if you'd like.

11:37.120 --> 11:38.510
I'll think about it.

11:38.510 --> 11:40.470
That means we'll definitely go!

11:44.780 --> 11:47.510
Are you planning on serving 
tea made from these leaves at your shop?

11:47.510 --> 11:48.570
Huh?

11:48.570 --> 11:53.000
It may be how it's brewed, but it tastes 
different from the leaves I normally drink.

11:53.000 --> 11:54.280
You can tell?

11:54.280 --> 11:55.800
Of course I can.

11:57.670 --> 12:00.820
These are tea leaves Ms. Lala 
obtained especially for our shop.

12:01.150 --> 12:04.330
Keeping the price down would be 
important for the shop.

12:04.330 --> 12:07.990
There would be no point practicing 
with high quality leaves.

12:09.230 --> 12:11.480
But the taste wasn't bad.

12:11.480 --> 12:14.210
I'll have another cup to review.

12:14.210 --> 12:15.860
Me, too.

12:15.860 --> 12:17.720
Oh, and another serving of cake!

12:17.720 --> 12:18.950
My lady.

12:18.950 --> 12:20.590
Just one more.

12:21.990 --> 12:24.430
You'll have to do extra exercises today.

12:24.430 --> 12:26.740
I will add a dance lesson for you.

12:26.740 --> 12:28.460
What?!

12:32.660 --> 12:34.490
M-Miss Nerin?

12:38.320 --> 12:40.070
Well? What do you think, Yuna?!

12:40.070 --> 12:43.020
You don't have to force yourself to wear that.

12:43.020 --> 12:46.470
But Karin Sis said I had to wear it.

12:46.470 --> 12:50.800
I'm wearing it, too. 
It's not fair if Nerin doesn't.

12:50.800 --> 12:55.490
I had Sherry and the couple at the tailor 
shop make it as quickly as possible.

12:56.120 --> 12:58.900
After all, I couldn't get Anz wear one.

13:00.740 --> 13:01.810
It looks good on you.

13:00.760 --> 13:04.010
As long as Miss Nerin 
is okay with it, I guess...

13:01.810 --> 13:03.690
Really?

13:03.690 --> 13:05.000
Yeah. Yeah.

13:04.520 --> 13:06.700
Miss Nerin seems to be having fun.

13:06.700 --> 13:07.920
Right.

13:12.350 --> 13:16.280
Hello, is Mister Ghazal in?

13:16.280 --> 13:19.610
Oh, it's you. They're done.

13:20.670 --> 13:24.570
These are my mithril knives...

13:24.570 --> 13:26.750
Can I test them out?

13:26.750 --> 13:29.370
Of course. I might need to make adjustments!

13:29.370 --> 13:31.040
What's that?

13:31.040 --> 13:33.010
An iron golem?!

13:33.010 --> 13:34.750
And, a bear?

13:40.460 --> 13:41.880
They're so pretty.

13:41.880 --> 13:45.120
The black one is for your right 
hand and the white one for your left!

13:45.120 --> 13:47.220
I matched your bear gloves!

13:47.530 --> 13:52.040
Since you said you'd dual wield, 
I customized the grips!

13:52.040 --> 13:53.870
Channel your mana through them!

13:54.600 --> 13:56.850
<i>This reminds me of my gamer days.</i>

13:56.850 --> 14:00.650
<i>I should be able to replicate 
those moves with my bear suit!</i>

14:09.030 --> 14:09.990
Whoa!

14:18.340 --> 14:22.020
Mister Ghazal! These knives are amazing!

14:22.020 --> 14:24.180
You're the one that's amazing.

14:24.180 --> 14:26.380
Take a look at the knives. Any chipping?

14:26.380 --> 14:29.450
That's the proof of your skill.

14:29.450 --> 14:33.030
Your blade technique and your 
mana control are both superb.

14:33.030 --> 14:36.500
It's all thanks to you 
making such amazing knives.

14:38.500 --> 14:41.650
Looks like I don't need to make any 
adjustments. You can put them away.

14:41.930 --> 14:42.710
Okay.

14:42.710 --> 14:44.100
Clean this up, too.

14:44.100 --> 14:47.610
I'll give that to you as a present 
for making me the best knives ever.

14:48.350 --> 14:50.070
You sure you're not just lazy?

14:50.070 --> 14:51.780
Of course not.

14:53.990 --> 14:55.620
I'll buy it from you.

14:55.620 --> 14:57.030
It's really fine.

14:57.030 --> 15:01.060
I'll bring you the money and 
the letter of introduction I promised.

15:01.060 --> 15:02.270
Thanks.

15:07.870 --> 15:10.680
Hello. Is Mrs. Ellalaura in?

15:10.680 --> 15:12.640
Please wait a moment.

15:14.810 --> 15:17.270
Yuna, you came to the capital?

15:17.270 --> 15:20.430
Yeah, I came to pick up my mithril knives.

15:20.430 --> 15:23.560
I thought I'd come see Princess 
Flora while I was at it.

15:23.560 --> 15:24.900
Excuse me.

15:24.900 --> 15:28.780
Thank you very much for the picture book!

15:28.780 --> 15:31.360
My child enjoys it very much!

15:31.360 --> 15:32.450
Huh?

15:32.450 --> 15:34.910
We can't wait for the next installment!

15:36.580 --> 15:38.810
Uh, what's going on?

15:38.810 --> 15:42.060
Why does she know I drew the picture book?

15:42.420 --> 15:46.590
Princess Flora has been telling 
everyone that a bear drew the book.

15:51.750 --> 15:53.720
This way, Miss Bear!

16:00.640 --> 16:01.630
Oh!

16:03.650 --> 16:05.080
Kumayuru?

16:05.080 --> 16:06.560
Bear!

16:06.560 --> 16:08.270
Princess Flora, you'll get wet.

16:08.270 --> 16:10.770
But the bear...

16:18.620 --> 16:21.540
The bear fell. I'll bring a towel.

16:21.540 --> 16:22.710
It's fine.

16:27.380 --> 16:28.600
Bear!

16:28.600 --> 16:30.100
Back to normal, right?

16:30.100 --> 16:32.650
Yeah! Thank goodness!

16:32.650 --> 16:34.420
How strange.

16:34.420 --> 16:35.840
Here you all are.

16:35.840 --> 16:37.680
Father!

16:37.680 --> 16:38.760
Hello.

16:38.760 --> 16:42.350
Welcome. Are you having tea here today?

16:42.350 --> 16:43.690
Yes.

16:43.690 --> 16:46.230
Then I'll join you.

16:53.070 --> 16:55.860
Thank you for your help.

16:55.860 --> 17:00.440
I'm the one who offered. 
I've been practicing lately.

17:00.440 --> 17:02.620
What about your work, Your Majesty?

17:02.620 --> 17:07.000
I left my son to do it. 
What about you, Ellalaura?

17:07.000 --> 17:10.580
It's my job to take care of Yuna right now.

17:13.860 --> 17:15.770
<i>They're so alike.</i>

17:16.150 --> 17:18.600
Here. Please drink it with the cake.

17:24.790 --> 17:26.560
You did well, Yuna.

17:26.560 --> 17:28.650
Yes, quite delicious.

17:28.650 --> 17:31.110
You have so many talents, Yuna.

17:33.400 --> 17:35.110
Here! Say, "Ahh!"

17:36.140 --> 17:37.710
So tasty!

17:38.860 --> 17:43.140
Oh, Yuna, I heard about the mine. Thank you.

17:43.140 --> 17:46.620
I only helped because 
I wanted some mithril knives.

17:46.620 --> 17:48.330
What did you have made?

17:48.330 --> 17:51.670
I had a harvesting knife made for Fina 
and some weapons for myself.

17:52.020 --> 17:54.880
You can use weapons <i>and</i> cast magic spells?

17:54.880 --> 17:56.770
I dabble in it.

17:59.700 --> 18:01.390
I apologize for interrupting 
your conversation!

18:01.390 --> 18:02.840
Zelef...

18:02.840 --> 18:04.800
Your Majesty!

18:04.800 --> 18:07.190
I did not know you were 
here as well! My apologies!

18:07.190 --> 18:11.900
It's strange to see Head Chef Zelef in 
a place that has nothing to do with cooking.

18:11.900 --> 18:16.340
Well, I heard that Miss Yuna 
was here. I came to say hello!

18:16.340 --> 18:20.240
I wasn't able to thank her properly 
for the pudding recipe.

18:20.240 --> 18:22.160
You don't need to worry about it...

18:22.160 --> 18:23.650
Of course I do!

18:24.240 --> 18:27.040
Recipes are the lifeline of a chef!

18:27.470 --> 18:29.750
<i>How gentlemanly.</i>

18:33.020 --> 18:34.380
Oh, my.

18:35.840 --> 18:38.100
Ms. Ange! Wh-What's this?

18:38.100 --> 18:40.680
This is a sweet from Miss Yuna.

18:40.680 --> 18:43.090
It's called shortcake.

18:43.090 --> 18:45.220
Would you like to try some, Mister Zelef?

18:46.220 --> 18:47.390
Are you sure?!

18:47.390 --> 18:48.850
Of course!

18:50.180 --> 18:51.680
Enjoy.

18:51.680 --> 18:53.140
Thank you.

18:55.470 --> 18:57.810
What is this white substance?

18:57.810 --> 18:59.650
Whipped cream.

18:59.650 --> 19:01.390
I've never seen it before.

19:04.210 --> 19:06.090
It smells of milk.

19:06.610 --> 19:09.400
Is that what this cream is made of?

19:11.420 --> 19:16.850
I see. There are layers made 
with strawberries and cream.

19:17.890 --> 19:19.300
Thank you for the dish.

19:32.700 --> 19:33.610
Huh?

19:36.060 --> 19:38.070
<i>H-He's crying?!</i>

19:39.090 --> 19:43.400
The cream and the cake are so soft!

19:43.400 --> 19:45.490
And the strawberries!

19:45.490 --> 19:49.940
Their tart juices mingle so well 
with the rich cream in the mouth!

19:49.940 --> 19:51.910
This is truly art!

19:52.460 --> 19:53.500
Huh?

19:52.460 --> 19:54.600
First the pudding, and now this shortcake!

19:54.600 --> 19:59.090
Miss Yuna knows of so many foods 
that I lack the knowledge of!

19:59.090 --> 20:01.480
They're all foods from my hometown.

20:01.920 --> 20:04.930
It's really far away so it makes sense 
that you've never tasted them.

20:04.930 --> 20:10.890
I'd like to go to different countries to 
taste the different foods of the world!

20:10.890 --> 20:12.490
That would be a problem.

20:12.490 --> 20:15.360
I would no longer be able to eat your food.

20:16.870 --> 20:19.520
I am honored you think that way.

20:19.520 --> 20:23.120
However, only the never-ending 
quest for new flavors

20:23.120 --> 20:25.820
can open up the path to new delicacies.

20:25.820 --> 20:30.700
It may be a good idea to invite 
chefs from other countries to see Zelef.

20:30.700 --> 20:32.660
What a great idea.

20:32.660 --> 20:35.960
Wait, who will be responsible for that?

20:35.960 --> 20:37.250
Of course...

20:37.250 --> 20:40.510
I cannot wait, Lady Ellalaura!

20:41.650 --> 20:43.730
Me, it seems...

20:46.640 --> 20:47.470
That's right.

20:47.470 --> 20:50.850
Let us treat you to dinner to thank you 
for the pudding and shortcake.

20:50.850 --> 20:52.070
You sure?

20:52.070 --> 20:56.260
Cooking for Miss Yuna 
will challenge my skills!

20:56.260 --> 20:58.190
I will make whatever you like!

20:58.190 --> 20:59.710
Yay!

20:59.710 --> 21:02.550
I get to eat dinner with bears!

21:02.550 --> 21:06.100
Then we'll be able to hold on 
to these cubs a little longer.

21:15.270 --> 21:20.340
No more... I ate too much.

21:22.390 --> 21:26.320
Mister Zelef's cooking was so delicious.

21:26.320 --> 21:29.600
No wonder the king won't let him go.

21:32.550 --> 21:38.930
Princess Flora and Queen Kitia 
really loved the two of you.

21:40.480 --> 21:45.200
Maybe I should make stuffed animal 
versions of Kumayuru and Kumakyu...

21:49.970 --> 21:55.100
I wonder if they'll be happy 
to get a present like that...

23:35.390 --> 23:39.980
<b>Bear, Knowing of Nobles</b>

23:35.430 --> 23:39.980
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:35.860 --> 23:37.260
Bear...
